 Opening (dir. by Atsuko Fukushima and Katsuhiro Otomo)\n\n2. Franken's Gears (dir. by Koji Morimoto)\n\n3. Deprive (dir. by Hidetoshi Omori)\n\n4. Presence (dir. by Yasuomi Umetsu)\n\n5. Star Light Angel (dir. by Hiroyuki Kitazume)\n\n6. Cloud (dir. by Mao Lamdo)\n\n7. A Tale of Two Robots (dir. by Hiroyuki Kitakubo)\n\n8. Nightmare (dir. by Takashi Nakamura)\n\n9. Ending (dir. by Atsuko Fukushima and Katsuhiro Otomo)"},"tags":[{"name":"Robots","rank":100,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Anthology","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"No Dialogue","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Episodic","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Post-Apocalyptic","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Steampunk","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Anachronism","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Dystopian","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Desert","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Classic Literature","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rotoscoping","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Robot Carnival","english":"Robot Carnival","native":"ロボット・カーニバル","romaji":"Robot Carnival","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"机器人嘉年华"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}